Summary
=======

Problem:
Administrators needed visibility into which devices were connected to the network.

Solution:
Device Tracking maintains an IP-MAC-VLAN-Port database.

Benefit:
Improves troubleshooting, endpoint visibility, and security monitoring.

Limitation:
Does not prevent MAC address impersonation.

